 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     PERFORM VARYING I1 FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I1 > 9
         MOVE 0.5 TO WS-D(I1)
     END-PERFORM
     MOVE 0 TO W1
     MOVE 0 TO W2
     MOVE 0 TO W3
     MOVE -0.375 TO W4
     MOVE -0.375 TO W5
     MOVE -0.375 TO W6
     MOVE 0 TO WS-FLAG1
     MOVE 0 TO WS-ARGB
