     CALL "P4-CRUMBLE-FIX" USING PCL W1
     MOVE "3.4 crumble lifetime lower bound 1" TO WS-NAME
     MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     COMPUTE TL-OBSERVED-N = PC-LIFETIME
     PERFORM ASSERT-NUMBER
     MOVE 0.2 TO W1
     MOVE 0.3 TO W2
     MOVE 0.5 TO W3
     MOVE -0.6 TO W4
     MOVE 0.5 TO W5
