 ASSERT-NUMBER.
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-CASE
     STRING "acceptance US12 42-4§3 The 33 types of this part: " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-NAME)
         DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-CASE
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT.

 ASSERT-TEXT.
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-CASE
     STRING "acceptance US12 42-4§3 The 33 types of this part: " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-NAME)
         DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-CASE
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT.
 END PROGRAM TEST-PARTICLES-42-4-3.
